ackward stars), as two planes of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UndirectedIncidenceList"},{"type":"text","text":"’s storage. Unprefixed, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdjacencyList"},{"type":"text","text":" is the directed one of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pair. ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"},{"type":"text","text":" is the matrix form; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IncidenceMatrix"},{"type":"text","text":" is undirected, because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“oriented incidence matrix” is the established name.)"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"IncidenceList","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"IncidenceList","kind":"identifier"}]}}}